6 Step 4: Treatment adherence
Proportion of Days Covered (PDC) is the standard measure of medication adherence in claims data. PDC ≥ 80% is the conventional threshold for “adherent.”


Code
# Summarise treatment adherence
adherence_result &lt;- cdm$dus_cohort |&gt;
  summariseTreatmentAdherence(
    followUpDays = 365
  )

adherence_result |&gt;
  filter(variable_name == "Proportion of patients covered") |&gt;
  select(estimate_name, estimate_value)

8 Restricting to a study period


Code
cdm$glp1_cohorts &lt;- cdm$glp1_cohorts |&gt;
  CohortConstructor::requireInDateRange(
    dateRange = as.Date(c("2023-01-01", "2024-12-31"))
  )

9 Age restriction


Code
cdm$glp1_cohorts &lt;- cdm$glp1_cohorts |&gt;
  CohortConstructor::requireAge(
    ageRange = list(c(18, 150))   # adults only
  )

10 Putting the full pipeline together


Code
# Full new-user cohort pipeline for GLP-1 RA agents
cdm &lt;- CohortConstructor::conceptCohort(
  cdm        = cdm,
  conceptSet = glp1_concepts,
  name       = "glp1_cohorts",
  domain     = "drug"
) 

cdm$glp1_cohorts &lt;- cdm$glp1_cohorts |&gt;
  requireIsFirstEntry()             |&gt;
  requireObservationBeforeDrug(days = 365) |&gt;
  requirePriorDrugWashout(days = 365)      |&gt;
  requireCohortIntersect(
    cohortTable   = "t2dm_cohort",
    cohortId      = 1,
    window        = c(-Inf, 0),
    intersections = c(1, Inf),
    name          = "glp1_cohorts"
  ) |&gt;
  requireAge(ageRange = list(c(18, 150))) |&gt;
  requireInDateRange(
    dateRange = as.Date(c("2023-01-01", "2024-12-31"))
  )

